,"stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385421872138977,"text_excerpt":"We loved 14 Parishes. Having honeymooned in Jamaica, it felt really special to go there and took us back to the amazing time we had in Jamaica. The food here was very good and authentic. We started with the stamp and go and the beef patties, and I could have sat there and just eaten those for my entree, they were so good my mouth is watering right now thinking of them. For our entrees my husband and I both got the jerk chicken, because how could we not? We got dark meat and it was so good, it also came with a spicy BBQ sauce that was very tasty. The chicken comes with 2 sides and the serving was very generous. I got Mac and cheese and mashed potatoes and they were both so yummy. The mashe..."},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","review_id":"m7wqmEU90f2jLcs_XLxdaA","date":"2018-03-04T17:01:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9346290230751038,"text_excerpt":"I felt in love with Jamaican cuisine when I visited the country. I have been wanting to satisfy my craving for Jamaican food lately and I was recommended to go couple of different restaurants but they are more of a food truck/lunch spot deal. Was on the hunt for a dinner spot and came across 14 Parishes on Yelp so why not give it a try! Fast forward and I am so glad that I got to check this place out! The menu looks like it is not extensive BUT it pretty much covers all the Jamaican essentials - they have got patties, jerk chicken, curry goats, stewed oxtail, soup, callaloo, steam veggies... To top them off, they got Jamaican beverages and cocktails as well. We were told ahead of the time..."},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","review_id":"744wDe1krrvP6iWkO4W5pA","date":"2018-06-14T19:54:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9302866458892822,"text_excerpt":"The food at 14 parishes is really good! Authentic Jamaican food that's beyond filling. The customer service there is A1 you can get great service from anyone including the chef! The rum punch is DANGEROUS (in a good way, of course) I had two glasses and before I knew it, t had gotten to me! The energy is very chill, and laid back. I would highly recommend! I love the jerked chicken with plantains Mack and cheese. There's a spicy chicken I forget the name of but it's awesome as well! Great place to visit if you're ever in the area!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","photo_id":"q51nXxeUxQHwDDH3Cedvcw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/q51nXxeUxQHwDDH3Cedvcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8318631052970886},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","photo_id":"Cavl39Km7OKtgSkmorzN0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Cavl39Km7OKtgSkmorzN0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8137495517730713},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","photo_id":"iP483JawkO8zVYell4X5yw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/iP483JawkO8zVYell4X5yw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7903679609298706},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","photo_id":"YdaYmV83pQ4pagBBG4Km4g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/YdaYmV83pQ4pagBBG4Km4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7785277366638184},{"business_id":"6xA3Zg26SbaftWvzf6Rn4Q","photo_id":"hPbow319ekOumOYvjjE61w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hPbow319ekOumOYvjjE61w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6946556568145752}]},"notebook_case":null}
